    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>You take a blast to the side of your head, burning away one ear and crisping the inner ear as well.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> You suffer the loss of one ear – @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.8piWcBKFlQ2J1E3A]{Amputation (Average)}. Also, for the rest of the encounter you gain @Condition[Fatigued] (2) from the dizziness as the fluids in the loop-shaped canals in your inner ear temporarily boil.</p>"
